                              '    """KV connectors that pin KV cache memory (e.g. via '
                              'ibv_reg_mr) are\n'
                              '    invalidated when expandable_segments lets the CUDA '
                              'VMM allocator remap\n'
                              "    the underlying physical pages. We can't enumerate "
                              'every connector that\n'
                              '    does this (especially OOT ones), so reject the '
                              'combination whenever any\n'
                              '    connector is configured."""\n'
                              '    monkeypatch.setenv("PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF", '
